  <div style="position:relative;width:100%;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto">
    <h1 style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(40px,6.4vw,88px);line-height:1.02;font-weight:900;color:#fff">Commercial Boiler Installation &amp; Repair</h1>
